    <preface>
      <p>Veterans’ Affairs Legislation Amendment (Miscellaneous Measures) Act 2014</p>
      <p>No. 5, 2014</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to veterans’ affairs and military rehabilitation and compensation, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	2</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
