      <p>No. 5, 2014</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the law relating to veterans’ affairs and military rehabilitation and compensation, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 28 February 2014</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
